WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:12.875
space station shook again.

2
00:00:12.895 --> 00:00:17.378
"I thought Furbit was small," Roxy said.

3
00:00:17.398 --> 00:00:20.220
"Furbit was small," Dr.

4
00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:20.801
Chen said.

5
00:00:20.821 --> 00:00:24.423
"But he keeps eating—and growing."

6
00:00:25.824 --> 00:00:26.805
Officer Wells nodded.

7
00:00:26.825 --> 00:00:29.167
"The more he eats, the bigger he gets.

8
00:00:29.507 --> 00:00:30.768
He's pretty big now."

9
00:00:31.904 --> 00:00:32.584
He shook his head.

10
00:00:32.604 --> 00:00:35.185
"I made a really big mistake!"

11
00:00:36.946 --> 00:00:38.187
Roxy had to find Furbit!

12
00:00:42.048 --> 00:00:43.269
She ran down some stairs.

13
00:00:44.709 --> 00:00:46.090
The space station shook again.

14
00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:48.651
Roxy heard a loud snort.

15
00:00:49.431 --> 00:00:50.672
She hurried toward the sound.

16
00:00:51.592 --> 00:00:52.253
"Rocket Girl!"

17
00:00:52.513 --> 00:00:53.313
an astronaut said.

18
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:54.914
"Thank goodness you're here!

19
00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:57.435
Furbit's in the big storage room.

20
00:00:58.015 --> 00:01:00.016
He's eating everything!

21
00:01:00.692 --> 00:01:02.233
Please do something!"

22
00:01:03.775 --> 00:01:05.056
Roxy found the storage room.

23
00:01:08.198 --> 00:01:09.940
She pressed a button, and the doors opened.

24
00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.141
She went in and looked around.

25
00:01:14.203 --> 00:01:15.804
A large satellite sat on the floor.

26
00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:18.607
Suddenly a shadow covered everything.

27
00:01:19.588 --> 00:01:20.909
Roxy looked up and gulped.

28
00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:29.796
Furbit!" An enormous, furry creature picked up the satellite.

29
00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.541
The creature tossed the satellite into its wide mouth.

30
00:01:34.262 --> 00:01:35.623
Crunch, crunch!

31
00:01:36.143 --> 00:01:39.505
Gulp! Furbit closed his eyes and smiled.

32
00:01:39.525 --> 00:01:43.187
"Hey!" Rocket Girl flew up to the creature's head.

33
00:01:43.207 --> 00:01:45.408
"Stop eating stuff!"

34
00:01:46.609 --> 00:01:48.130
Suddenly Furbit looked scared.

35
00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:50.931
The creature swung a big paw at Roxy.

36
00:01:51.491 --> 00:01:54.273
Whap! The paw knocked Roxy across the room.

37
00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:57.535
Bam! Roxy slammed into a wall.

38
00:02:00.328 --> 00:02:01.409
Roxy stamped her foot.

39
00:02:02.369 --> 00:02:04.050
Then she shot back toward Furbit.

40
00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:05.711
"Don't hit me again!"

41
00:02:05.731 --> 00:02:11.294
"Furbit!" The big creature batted Roxy with its other paw.

42
00:02:11.894 --> 00:02:13.916
Again Roxy was thrown across the room.

43
00:02:14.916 --> 00:02:17.097
By now the astronauts were gathered in the doorway.

44
00:02:17.117 --> 00:02:18.718
"Oh no!"

45
00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:19.859
Dr. Chen said.

46
00:02:19.879 --> 00:02:22.320
"I hope Rocket Girl is okay."

47
00:02:23.501 --> 00:02:24.681
Roxy was furious.

48
00:02:25.282 --> 00:02:27.183
She got ready to shoot toward the big creature.

49
00:02:27.703 --> 00:02:29.044
But then she stopped herself.

50
00:02:30.836 --> 00:02:33.277
"Maybe Furbit is scared," Roxy thought.

51
00:02:33.297 --> 00:02:35.718
"I'll try to calm him down."

52
00:02:36.619 --> 00:02:39.580
Roxy carefully took a few steps toward the huge creature.

53
00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:42.541
"There, there," she said softly.

54
00:02:42.561 --> 00:02:44.382
"It's okay.

55
00:02:45.102 --> 00:02:46.343
I won't hurt you."

56
00:02:47.643 --> 00:02:48.784
Furbit tilted his head.

57
00:02:48.804 --> 00:02:53.446
"Furbit?" Roxy smiled and held out her hand.

58
00:02:53.466 --> 00:02:57.688
"Furbit!" Furbit moved closer to Roxy.

59
00:02:59.168 --> 00:03:00.870
The big creature held out his paw.

60
00:03:04.032 --> 00:03:05.073
Roxy patted his paw.

61
00:03:06.814 --> 00:03:08.055
Furbit purred loudly.

62
00:03:11.718 --> 00:03:12.579
Roxy sighed.

63
00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:15.241
Then she turned to the astronauts.

64
00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:17.523
"Bring me Furbit's spaceship!"

65
00:03:20.606 --> 00:03:23.248
Officer Wells carried a tiny spaceship into the room.

66
00:03:24.609 --> 00:03:25.470
Roxy groaned.

67
00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:27.892
"Furbit can't fit in that!"

68
00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.262
Rumble, rumble!

69
00:03:31.782 --> 00:03:32.943
Furbit's belly growled.

70
00:03:34.124 --> 00:03:35.965
Roxy looked up at Furbit and sighed.

71
00:03:36.626 --> 00:03:38.207
"You're hungry again?

72
00:03:38.527 --> 00:03:39.468
You just—"
